# run.sh-restored HAL vendor snapshots (not needed where the platform tree is
# vendored). The reloc/overlay examples have no board-hosted platform, so they
# commit their own vendor/ snapshot instead — un-ignore those four.
*/vendor/
!combo-reloc/vendor/
!spifs-reloc/vendor/
!combo-overlay/vendor/
!spifs-overlay/vendor/
/README.pdf

